    "Common_StopStageRuns": {
        "doc": "把 Battle_ClearStage_Count.max_hit 归零 ⟹ 本轮不再刷，走 Finish 收尾。\n归零后 next 接 Battle_ClearStage_Cycle，让流程自己走完收尾（比直接终止干净）。",
        "recognition": {
            "type": "DirectHit",
            "param": {}
        },
        "action": {
            "type": "Custom",
            "param": {
                "custom_action": "stop_stage_runs",
                "custom_action_param": {
                    "count_node": "Battle_ClearStage_Count"
                }
            }
        },
        "next": [
            "[JumpBack]Common_NetWait",
            "Battle_ClearStage_Cycle"
        ],
        "post_delay": 300
    },
    "Common_StaminaMail": {
        "doc": "邮件领体力的固定路径（用户 2026-09-22 给的路）：\n    社交 → 我的消息 → 体力领取 → 顶部「战斗」→ Battle_PickStage\n\n⚠️ 最后**不点返回**：用户实测点完「体力领取」直接点顶部「战斗」标签就回去了\n（因为战斗页有滞留，回去的还是原来那个关卡列表）。\n\n⚠️ 全程**不写死关卡信息** —— 回关卡列表后靠 Battle_PickStage，\n而它的关卡名/坐标是界面「关卡定位」灌进来的，这是唯一的参数来源。",
        "recognition": {
            "type": "DirectHit",
            "param": {}
        },
        "action": {
            "type": "DoNothing",
            "param": {}
        },
        "next": [
            "[JumpBack]Common_NetWait",
            "Common_StaminaMail_Social"
        ]
    },
